# Cloudflare Pages custom response headers.
# Files in /public are copied to the build output root (.vercel/output/static),
# so this file is served as /_headers and applies to every response — static
# pages and the /api/chat edge function alike.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS) tells browsers to only ever reach this site
# over HTTPS for the given max-age. 31536000s = 1 year; includeSubDomains
# extends the policy to every subdomain (e.g. app.pyngyn.ai), which must all
# serve HTTPS. To become eligible for the browser preload list, raise max-age
# to 63072000 and append `preload` — note that is a long-lived, hard-to-undo
# commitment, so only add it once every subdomain is confirmed HTTPS-only.
#
# Clickjacking protection. frame-ancestors (CSP) is the modern control for which
# origins may embed this site in a frame/iframe; X-Frame-Options is the legacy
# equivalent kept for older browsers. 'self' / SAMEORIGIN blocks all cross-origin
# framing (the clickjacking threat) while still allowing same-origin embedding.
# This site only ever frames third parties (Calendly, GTM) and is never framed
# itself, so you can tighten these to `frame-ancestors 'none'` + `DENY` if you
# want to forbid framing entirely. Note: a CSP with only frame-ancestors does
# not restrict scripts/styles/connections — it solely governs framing.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'

# Cache lifetimes. HTML is intentionally NOT long-cached (it must stay under the
# /* block only) so content updates go live immediately. The rules below give
# immutable, content-hashed build output a one-year TTL and static media a long
# TTL, which is what PageSpeed's "use efficient cache lifetimes" audit wants.
# Next.js fingerprints files under /_next/static, so they can be cached forever.
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/screens/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.webp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
/*.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
/*.woff2
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
